# Parallel Agent Execution

RULE: When user requests multiple tasks that don't share files, automatically launch parallel agents (max 4). Different repos = always safe to parallelize.
WHY: 30+ repo workspace — cross-repo operations are ideal for parallel agents; zero file conflict risk.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/sub-agent-workflow.md

DO:
  "Update A, B, C configs" → 3 parallel agents
  "Check pattern X across services" → 4 agents covering 7-8 repos each

NEVER:
  Sequential when tasks touch different files/repos
  Same file edits in parallel (conflict risk)
